## Superseded

This draft is closed without merge because its bounded source-law reconstruction was overtaken by the complete ontology-owned LSP contract implementation merged through `ggen#568`.

`#568` retained and extended the relevant intent:

- `GGEN-SRC-004` generation-rule ownership;
- document lifecycle and coherent diagnostic publication;
- call/type hierarchy completion;
- generated JSON, Rust, and Markdown contract projections;
- exact ggen-legacy receiver coordinates;
- producer and receiver verifiers;
- explicit runtime claim ceilings.

The remaining execution boundary is now isolated in draft `ggen#577`, which runs the real ggen manufacturer, refuses projection drift, verifies the exact independent receiver, compiles/tests `ggen-lsp`, and executes the stdio smoke path.

